{"982210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CUBESCAPE", "steam_appid": 982210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CubeScape</strong> is a first-person atmospheric experience about self-reflection, perception, and a vanishing reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.poster.avif?t=1756606417\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.webm?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.mp4?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You enter a gallery named <strong>Tesseract</strong>, but soon the exhibits fade, the walls collapse, and you’re left wandering strange cubic worlds — each obeying its own logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal spaces, interact with mysterious objects, trigger mechanisms, and uncover symbolic links between your surroundings and your inner self. This journey won’t give you clear answers — it will make you ask the right questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.poster.avif?t=1756606417\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.webm?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.mp4?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with full movement freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects, activate mechanisms, affect the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story told through space and sound — no dialogue, no HUD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical themes: memory, perception, inner transformation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal, dreamlike environments built on geometric abstraction</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CubeScape</strong> is a first-person atmospheric experience about self-reflection, perception, and a vanishing reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.poster.avif?t=1756606417\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.webm?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.mp4?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You enter a gallery named <strong>Tesseract</strong>, but soon the exhibits fade, the walls collapse, and you’re left wandering strange cubic worlds — each obeying its own logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal spaces, interact with mysterious objects, trigger mechanisms, and uncover symbolic links between your surroundings and your inner self. This journey won’t give you clear answers — it will make you ask the right questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.poster.avif?t=1756606417\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.webm?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.mp4?t=1756606417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with full movement freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects, activate mechanisms, affect the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story told through space and sound — no dialogue, no HUD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical themes: memory, perception, inner transformation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal, dreamlike environments built on geometric abstraction</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You look at the painting. But you don’t know — it’s him. A man who once loved, suffered, believed. Now he hangs on your wall. He doesn’t breathe. He doesn’t remember. But his gaze… it’s still there.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/2a7e1d80c6f1a640c95d7503fae74fdf1c83c143/header.jpg?t=1756606417", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/c157f69dd42f77574de44421a2947a16bdbd0a5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756606417", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/c157f69dd42f77574de44421a2947a16bdbd0a5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756606417", "website": null, "pc_requirements